{"t":"ROL","made":"2026-11-12 00:07","name":"Rollins, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Personal Services","employees":22000,"hq":"Atlanta, GA, United States","website":"https://www.rollins.com","summary_en":"Rollins, Inc., through its subsidiaries, provides pest and wildlife control services and protection to residential and commercial customers in the United States and internationally. The company offers pest control services to residential properties protecting from common pests, including rodents, insects, and wildlife. It also provides workplace pest control solutions for customers across various end markets, such as healthcare, food service, and logistics. In addition, the company offers termite protection and ancillary services for both residential and commercial customers. It serves clients directly, as well as through franchisee operations. The company was formerly known as Rollins Broadcasting, Inc and changed its name to Rollins, Inc. in 1965. Rollins, Inc. was founded in 1901 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Rollins, Inc.는 자회사를 통해 미국 및 전 세계의 주거 및 상업 고객에게 해충 및 야생 동물 방제 서비스와 보호 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 설치류, 곤충, 야생 동물을 포함한 일반적인 해충으로부터 보호하는 주거용 건물에 해충 방제 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 의료, 식품 서비스, 물류 등 다양한 최종 시장의 고객을 위한 직장 해충 방제 솔루션을 제공합니다. 또한 회사는 주거용 및 상업용 고객 모두를 위해 흰개미 보호 및 보조 서비스를 제공합니다. 프랜차이즈 운영뿐만 아니라 고객에게 직접 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 이전에 Rollins Broadcasting, Inc로 알려져 있었고 1965년에 Rollins, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Rollins, Inc.는 1901년에 설립되었으며 조지아주 애틀랜타에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":37.77,"mcap":18172862464.0,"pe":34.651375,"fpe":30.67689,"peg":3.4611,"ps":4.557363,"pb":12.983844,"ev_ebitda":22.333,"div":2.08,"beta":0.72,"hi52":66.14,"lo52":29.29},"fin":{"rev":3987582976.0,"rev_g":0.062,"eps_g":-0.023,"gross":0.52139,"op":0.18459,"net":0.13194,"roe":0.36004,"fcf":555143360.0,"cash":129050000.0,"debt":1125708032.0,"de":80.96,"eps":1.09,"feps":1.23122},"own":{"short":0.0915,"inst":0.62623,"insider":0.39102},"analyst":{"n":17,"me